This repository includes skills from the following projects, each under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. In each folder under migrations, the upstream
folder holds the original files unchanged and the genie folder holds the Genie
copy. Each changed Genie SKILL.md says that it was modified, and CHANGES.md
and genie.diff list every change. Source commits and file hashes are in
migrations/PROVENANCE.json.

- write-query, from anthropics/knowledge-work-plugins
  https://github.com/anthropics/knowledge-work-plugins
  License: data/LICENSE in that repository, copied to
  migrations/write-query/genie/write-query/LICENSE and
  migrations/write-query/context/data_LICENSE.
  migrations/write-query/genie/write-query/references/databricks-sql.md is the
  Databricks SQL section of the sql-queries skill in the same repository.

- internal-comms and theme-factory, from anthropics/skills
  https://github.com/anthropics/skills
  License: LICENSE.txt in each skill folder.

- define-goal and security-threat-model, from openai/skills
  https://github.com/openai/skills
  License: LICENSE.txt in each skill folder.

None of these projects shipped a NOTICE file at the pinned commits.

